{
  "title": { "zh": "一个目标变几个" },
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "拼接有两条前提，倒着用它，一个目标变成两个，排成一列。元件总是处理第一个目标；证完一个，下一个顶上来。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "r-subgoals",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "proved",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } }],
      "tests": [
        { "goal": "Rain → (Wind → Rain ∧ Wind)" },
        { "goal": "Wet → (Slip → Wet ∧ Slip)" },
        { "goal": "¬Rain → (Wind → ¬Rain ∧ Wind)" }
      ],
      "brief": { "zh": "设计一个证明助手，证完每一个目标。" },
      "hint": [{ "zh": "「并且」的两半，各自在已知里吗？" }],
      "solution": [
        "c0r0 = impI()",
        "c1r0 = impI()",
        "c2r0 = andI()",
        "c0 = rule(in, c0r0)",
        "c1 = rule(c0, c1r0)",
        "c2 = rule(c1, c2r0)",
        "c3 = assumption(c2)",
        "c4 = assumption(c3)",
        "out <- c4"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
